rs","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottmitch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottmitch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottmitch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottmitch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottmitch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottmitch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottmitch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottmitch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"Scottmitch","id":7562868,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1NjI4Njg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7562868?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottmitch","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottmitch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottmitch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottmitch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottmitch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottmitch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottmitch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottmitch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottmitch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottmitch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottmitch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/milestones/117","html_url":"https://github.com/netty/netty/milestone/117","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/milestones/117/labels","id":1100817,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lMTEwMDgxNw==","number":117,"title":"4.1.0.Beta6","description":"","creator":{"login":"normanmaurer","id":439362,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTM2Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/439362?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer","html_url":"https://github.com/normanmaurer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":102,"state":"closed","created_at":"2015-05-07T19:29:09Z","updated_at":"2015-11-08T03:17:09Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2015-09-04T17:07:03Z"},"comments":7,"created_at":"2015-08-02T09:29:45Z","updated_at":"2015-08-17T17:16:55Z","closed_at":"2015-08-17T07:59:34Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Netty Version: 5.0.0.Alpha3-SNAPSHOT (latest master)\n\nIssue:\nWhen the `SpdyHttpDecoder` attempts to decode a SPDY Frame into a `FullHttpRequest` a `NullPointerException` is thrown on [this line](https://github.com/netty/netty/blob/master/codec-http/src/main/java/io/netty/handler/codec/spdy/SpdyHttpDecoder.java#L353).  \n\nThe reason is that the call to `headers.getAndConvert(METHOD)` returns `null`. `headers` _does_ contain the `:method` pseudo-header, the problem is that `METHOD` is `AsciiString`, but `headers` is looking for a key of type `String`.  If you call `headers.getAndConvert(METHOD.toString())` the lookup succeeds.\n\nI think this issue has been introduced because of: d31fa31cdcc5ea2fa96116e3b1265baa180df58a\nThis issue may also be present in other codecs/handlers that try to lookup headers.  This is the first place I spotted it.\n\n/cc @buchgr @Scottmitch - You two seem to be the best placed to solve this one :smile: \n","closed_by":{"login":"blucas","id":1743698,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDM2OTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1743698?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blucas","html_url":"https://github.com/blucas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blucas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blucas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blucas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blucas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blucas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blucas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blucas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blucas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blucas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/4053/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/4053/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}